# This file must live at the repo root: every image in devops/docker builds with
# `context: ../..`, and Docker only reads `.dockerignore` from the context root.
#
# Keep this list free of `!` negations. A negation that could match inside an
# excluded directory forces BuildKit to walk that directory anyway — which makes
# it stat bun's workspace symlinks under node_modules, and those are unreadable
# to the Windows build-context sender, failing the build before it starts.
# Nothing here is needed at build time: each Dockerfile runs its own bun install.
.git
.cursor
docs
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/uploads
**/cypress/videos
**/cypress/screenshots
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.development
**/.env.production
**/.DS_Store
society-hub.code-workspace
